Z||000006||KissMySSFiero||05-31-2001||11:43 PM||||TTOPS.  go for it.  you can do anything to the ttop car that you can do to the other.  it may cost you but it can be done.  t tops you arent as likely to be able to do to your 85 unless you happen to stumble on a nice set at a junk yard.  <P>------------------<BR>JOEJOE Aol:SSFiero <P>88FORMULA<BR>      <A HREF="mailto:SSFiero@Aol.com">SSFiero@Aol.com</A>       <P>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FORUMSIG1.jpg">           <BR>"Kids in the backseat cause accidents,  accidents in the backseat caused me!!"||||reg||1
